nputs</a></li><li><a href="framework7-labels-and-inputs">Framework7 Labels &amp; Inputs</a></li></ul></div><div class="col-3"><p><strong>Framework7 Tabs</strong></p><ul class="points"><li><a href="framework7-tabs">Framework7 Tabs</a></li><li><a href="framework7-animated-tabs">Framework7 Animated Tabs</a></li><li><a href="framework7-inline-tabs">Framework7 Inline Tabs</a></li><li><a href="framework7-swipeable-tabs">Framework7 Swipeable Tabs</a></li><li><a href="framework7-show-tab-using-javascript">Show Tab Using JS</a></li><li><a href="framework7-switch-tabs-from-navbar">Switch Tabs From Navbar</a></li><li><a href="framework7-tabs-javascript-events">Tabs JavaScript Events</a></li></ul><p><strong>Framework7 Swiper Slide</strong></p><ul class="points"><li><a href="framework7-swiper-slider">Framework7 Swiper Slider</a></li><li><a href="framework7-custom-controls">Framework7 Custom Controls</a></li><li><a href="framework7-default-swiper-with-pagination">Framework7 Default Swiper</a></li><li><a href="framework7-lazy-loading">Framework7 Lazy Loading</a></li><li><a href="framework7-multiple-swipers">Framework7 Multiple Swipers</a></li><li><a href="framework7-nested-swipers">Framework7 Nested Swipers</a></li><li><a href="framework7-vertical-swiper">Framework7 Vertical Swiper</a></li><li><a href="framework7-space-between-slides">Framework7 Space b/w Slides</a></li></ul><p><strong>Framework7 Photo Browser</strong></p><ul class="points"><li><a href="framework7-photo-browser">Framework7 Photo Browser</a></li><li><a href="framework7-create-photo-browser-instance">Create Photo Browser</a></li><li><a href="framework7-photos-array">Framework7 Photos Array</a></li><li><a href="framework7-photo-browser-methods-and-properties">Photo Browser Methods</a></li><li><a href="framework7-photo-browser-parameters">Photo Browser Parameters</a></li></ul></div><div class="col-3"><p><strong>Framework7 Picker</strong></p><ul class="points"><li><a href="framework7-picker">Framework7 Picker</a></li><